-### Stage 2: Manual (Instructor Review in Colab)
+| Code | System | Meaning | ICD-10 Ref |
+|------|--------|---------|------------|
+| **44054006** | SNOMED CT | Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus | E11 |
+| **59621000** | SNOMED CT | Essential Hypertension | I10 |
+| **4548-4** | LOINC | Hemoglobin A1c (HbA1c) | - |
